High Density Housing / Commercial - New Building - To provide exterior alterations to the existing outdoor courtyard in this  existing Art Gallery (Bill Reid Gallery) on this site consisting of:

1. Removal of existing benches;
2. Patching and repairing;
3. Addition of a fabricated steel and glass pavilion;
4. Addition of glass panels to existing concrete fence.

Notes:
- See related DP-2018-00241.
- Schedule A, Mitchell Sakumoto, Architect, AIBC
  Schedule B - Architectural, Structural & Electrical

Field Review - Outdoor Uses (No Buildings Proposed) - In accordance with Section 4.4 of the Zoning and Development By-law, your request is granted, thereby permitting:
- alterations to landscaping features (gates and posts);
- additions of a water feature; and
- a deck and hot tub at the rear of the property to the existing one-family dwelling with an attached three-car garage having vehicular access from Laurier Avenue;

High Density Housing / Commercial - Addition / Alteration - Exterior alterations to replace the windows and the waterproofing membranes on balconies, and localized concrete wall repairs to this existing high-rise residential building.

Scope of work:
- Replace all windows and balcony doors;
- Replace all guardrails at balconies;
- Apply polyurethane membrane to all balconies;
- Repair localized concrete delamination around openings as needed.  

Notes:
- Schedule B - Architectural & Schedule D1 submitted
- All existing landscape to be retained and protected.

High Density Housing / Commercial - Addition / Alteration - Building Envelope Repair to targeted stucco cladding system, and exterior alterations to replace windows and balcony membranes for this 3-storey multi-unit residential building on the site.

Scope of work:
- Replace stucco cladding system at southwest exit with rainscreen stucco;
- Replace windows and balcony doors;
- Replace deck and balcony waterproofing membranes;
- Replace balcony guardrails.

Notes:
- Schedule A, Alfredo Jo, P.Eng.
  Schedule B - Architectural and Structural
  Schedule D1 submitted

Field Review - Addition / Alteration - Interior alteration to change the use of the existing Retail Store to a temporary sales presentation centre (similar to General Office) for a limited period of time expiring Oct 18, 2019, unless extended in writing by the Director of Planning, and also interior alterations to provide tenant improvements to create a display bathroom and display kitchen.    
   
Conditions of approval:    
(1) The proposed presentation centre is approved for a limited period of time expiring Oct 18th, 2019 unless extended in writing by the Director of Planning;    
   
(2) All mock-up display suite walls, kitchen equipment, plumbing fixtures are to be removed on or before the expiry date or at the time the tenant vacates the building; 
   
(3) The display kitchen and bathroom fixtures are NON-WORKING fixtures only (not to be plumbed);
   
(4) All glazing to remain clear and unobstructed at all times. No films, signage, shelving or similar elements to be installed without further approval from the Director of Planning.    

Okay for field review as per E.Kai Oct18/18

